          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What is the correct order of Box Model from inside to outside?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Content → Padding → Border → Margin</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Margin → Border → Padding → Content</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Content → Margin → Border → Padding</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Padding → Content → Margin → Border</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Padding is space?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> INSIDE the box</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> OUTSIDE the box</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Between 2 pages</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> Nowhere</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. Margin is space?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> INSIDE the box</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> OUTSIDE the box</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> Inside text</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> Nowhere</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. How to center a box?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> margin: 0 auto;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> padding: 0 auto;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> border: 0 auto;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> text-align: 0 auto;</label></div>
